tr: Forja closed again while opening the sound: on this console games will run without sound

es: El juego no pudo iniciar: falta la BIOS de la PS2. Cópiala por FTP a /data/ForjaSX2/bios
tr: The game could not start: the PS2 BIOS is missing. Copy it by FTP to /data/ForjaSX2/bios

